<title>UK: Banco America do Sul raises $60 mln via two bonds.</title>
<headline>Banco America do Sul raises $60 mln via two bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two bond issues were announced by lead manager Credit Lyonnais.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO AMERICA DO SUL SA</p>
<p> AMT	  $40 MLN   COUPON     9.75	MATURITY    20.SEP.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.5173   PAY DATE    20.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    99.5173   SPREAD	+340 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10-100    LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.50	HOME CTRY   BRAZIL</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.00 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 15.AUG.99</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT	  $20 MLN   COUPON     8.25	MATURITY    22.SEP.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    20.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	**</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10-100    LISTING    LUX	 HOME CTRY   BRAZIL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
